  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haiti - Education for All Project - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to support: (i) enrollment of students in select non-public primary schools in disadvantagedareas;(ii) student attendance in select public and non-public primary schools in disadvantaged areas; and (iii) strengthened management of the Recipient&apos;s primary education sector.</narrative>
  </description>
